  unitName: Geirdriful (EU)
  unitId: 760113
  unitNumber: 7035
  description: Part of the pantheon of fierce warriors coming from the coldest territories
    of Grand Gaia. Their legend tells us that 6 exceptional semi-goddesses select
    among the best of dying combatants, whom would be granted the right to enter
    their heaven and fight side by side with the gods. Geirdriful has a strong affinity
    to war and black magic. She is the one to decide the fate of fallen chiefs, generals,
    and sorcerers.
  summonDesc: Nice to meet you! Are you well versed in the Dark Arts?
  fusionDesc: Mmmm fusion... What an interesting concept
